      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "S01",
          "narration_id": "N1",
          "text": "1919年午夜，全城同时放起了爵士乐。",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.133,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.92,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.81,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.81,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 0.03,
          "speech_end": 3.84,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S02",
          "narration_id": "N1",
          "text": "一封信说：放爵士的家，斧头不会落下。",
          "start": 5.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.981,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.68,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.57,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.35,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0475,
          "speech_start": 5.03,
          "speech_end": 9.38,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S03",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "故事从一年前说起。1918年5月，新奥尔良一家杂货店。",
          "start": 10.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.606,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.38,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.27,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.27,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 10.03,
          "speech_end": 16.3,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S04",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "深夜，凶手蹲在后门口，用凿子，一点一点凿开一个方洞。",
          "start": 17.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.61,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.5,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.5,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 17.03,
          "speech_end": 22.53,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.143
        },
        {
          "id": "S05",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "他没有惊动任何人，只在墙上留下一个斧头影子。",
          "start": 24.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.133,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.01,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.9,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.9,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 24.03,
          "speech_end": 27.93,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S06",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "清晨，弟弟推开门，抽屉里的钱，一分没少。",
          "start": 30.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.214,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.02,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.91,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.91,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 30.03,
          "speech_end": 33.94,
          "characters": 16,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
        },
        {
          "id": "S07",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "接下来一年多，斧头一次次落在意大利裔杂货店家中。",
          "start": 35.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.41,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.21,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.1,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.1,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 35.03,
          "speech_end": 40.13,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.143
        },
        {
          "id": "S08",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "凶手总是从后门进来，用的，常常是主人家自己的斧头。",
          "start": 42.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.59,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.48,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.48,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 42.03,
          "speech_end": 47.51,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.143
        },
        {
          "id": "S09",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "警方疲于奔命，居民把斧头藏进柜子，把门窗钉死。",
          "start": 49.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.0,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.54,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.43,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.43,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 49.03,
          "speech_end": 54.46,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S10",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "入夜以后，全城戒严，门窗紧闭。",
          "start": 55.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.924,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.75,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.64,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.64,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 55.03,
          "speech_end": 58.67,
          "characters": 12,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S11",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "1919年3月10日，河对岸的格雷特纳，一家杂货店。",
          "start": 60.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.223,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.85,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.74,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.74,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 60.03,
          "speech_end": 65.77,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
        },
        {
          "id": "S12",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "那一夜，店主夫妇受了重伤。屋里，摇篮空着。",
          "start": 67.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.329,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.08,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.97,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.97,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 67.03,
          "speech_end": 72.0,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S13",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "警方一度把邻居父子当成凶手，两人被判重刑。",
          "start": 74.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.4,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.2,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.09,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.09,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 74.03,
          "speech_end": 79.12,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S14",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "一年多后，那份关键证词，被指有问题。",
          "start": 80.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.133,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.82,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.71,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.71,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 80.03,
          "speech_end": 83.74,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S15",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "三月中旬，报纸头版登出一封怪信，署名“来自地狱”。",
          "start": 85.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.283,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.05,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.94,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.94,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 85.03,
          "speech_end": 89.97,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S16",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "落款：来自地狱。写于1919年3月13日。",
          "start": 91.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.6,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.3,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.19,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.19,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 91.03,
          "speech_end": 96.22,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S17",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "信里说：下周二午夜十二点十五分，我会经过新奥尔良。",
          "start": 97.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.4,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.1,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.99,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.99,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 97.03,
          "speech_end": 102.02,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S18",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "信里说：屋里要放着爵士乐，我就放过这一家。",
          "start": 103.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.12,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.84,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.73,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.73,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 103.03,
          "speech_end": 107.76,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
        },
        {
          "id": "S19",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "3月19日，圣约瑟夫节前夜，全城行动起来。",
          "start": 108.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.899,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.65,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.54,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.54,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 108.03,
          "speech_end": 112.57,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S20",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "作曲家达维拉，连夜写出一首《神秘斧头手的爵士》。",
          "start": 114.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.56,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.45,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.45,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 114.03,
          "speech_end": 119.48,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S21",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "午夜十二点十五分，整座城的爵士乐，震耳欲聋。",
          "start": 120.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.899,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.66,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.55,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.55,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 120.03,
          "speech_end": 124.58,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S22",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "那一夜，没有人遇害。乐声响到天亮。",
          "start": 125.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.516,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.26,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.15,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.15,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 125.03,
          "speech_end": 129.18,
          "characters": 14,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S23",
          "narration_id": "N7",
          "text": "可半年后，1919年10月27日，斧头杀手又回来了一次。",
          "start": 130.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.58,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.47,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.47,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 130.03,
          "speech_end": 135.5,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S24",
          "narration_id": "N7",
          "text": "杂货店主迈克·佩皮托内，在卧室里遇害。这是最后一起。",
          "start": 137.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.432,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.26,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.15,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.15,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 137.03,
          "speech_end": 143.18,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.143
        },
        {
          "id": "S25",
          "narration_id": "N7",
          "text": "妻子埃丝特冲进卧室，只看见一个背影，从后门逃走。",
          "start": 144.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.41,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.15,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.04,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.04,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 144.03,
          "speech_end": 149.07,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S26",
          "narration_id": "N8",
          "text": "之后，斧头杀手再也没出现。案卷被推进档案柜。",
          "start": 150.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.793,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.47,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.36,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.36,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 150.03,
          "speech_end": 155.39,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S27",
          "narration_id": "N8",
          "text": "一年多后，洛杉矶，埃丝特朝一个男人开了枪。",
          "start": 156.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.87,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.76,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.76,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 156.03,
          "speech_end": 160.79,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S28",
          "narration_id": "N8",
          "text": "她说，那个人叫蒙弗尔，就是斧头杀手。可研究者找不到他。",
          "start": 162.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.712,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.52,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.41,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.41,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 162.03,
          "speech_end": 167.44,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S29",
          "narration_id": "N9",
          "text": "斧头杀手到底是谁？一百年了，没有答案。",
          "start": 168.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.725,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.45,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.34,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.34,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 168.03,
          "speech_end": 172.37,
          "characters": 16,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S30",
          "narration_id": "N9",
          "text": "今晚他要是再来敲门，你家放哪首歌？",
          "start": 174.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.435,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.2,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.09,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.09,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 174.03,
          "speech_end": 178.12,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.5
        }
      ],
